{include:suiteHead}

<p>
  Every test here is a page of an application without a suite of its own - the demos, the
  documentation front, the utilities - fetched over HTTP one request at a time, and
  compared with the prediction of the same name in <code>apps/regression/other/</code>.
  The pages stay in their own applications; the store holds nothing but what each must
  answer. A new application lands here as <b>new</b> until its predictions are written -
  and a page that draws, the clock and the counter among them, answers a
  <code>/pattern/</code> pinning its skeleton, everything else an exact body.
</p>

{include:suiteTable}